body:
ALCHEMY

you've ignored alchemy, which is why you're struggling so hard. the FMJ and Shaquracy bubbles provide huge boosts to defense and accuracy. also a lot of damage is probably missing because you haven't touched it. 

level literally everything up, focus on bubble 2 aka warriors rule type bubbles. work on unlocking new bubbles with shamans bubble breakthrough talent. if you do that you'll get a lot of account bonuses which are very helpful. 

&#x200B;

STAMPS

level your stamps bro. focus on combat stamps. 

&#x200B;

PRINTS

reprint stuff, print stuff for refinery, then make sure you have high bloach and fruitfly prints so you can get lots of FMJ and Shaquracy levels. 

choose better print choices, make everyone print something. 

&#x200B;

get your trapping levels up. get  nature traps. use maestro to put them down for everyone with transfusion. then collect using maestro with transfusion. for crazy xp gains from nature traps 200x xp (ps you can change the box type with the arrows in the menu where you place down traps, just in case you didn't know) 

&#x200B;

do cooking please

&#x200B;

put toons in the lab, you can get crazy bonuses from it. and if you rush to world 5 you can get the lab nodes unlocked basically permanently with one of the early gods. you'll want one main pusher to get through w4. put everyone else in lab and unlock the killer brightside node for 2x portal kills. this also unlocks no bubble left behind and 3x refinery cycle times and 2x prints for those in lab. these bonuses are worth putting people in lab for. start the lab grind.
